# ⚡ CloudForge

**Desktop + Cloud LLM Training & Experimentation Platform**

CloudForge is a modular Electron desktop application that orchestrates distributed LLM training, RAG experimentation, and insights generation using cloud GPUs (RunPod) and open-source tools.

## 🚀 Features

- **🖥️ Desktop GUI**: Intuitive Electron interface for experiment configuration
- **☁️ Cloud GPU Integration**: Automatic deployment to RunPod A100/H100 clusters
- **🧪 Multi-Variant Experiments**: Compare QLoRA, DoRA, full finetuning, and more
